{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30244","headline":"北亭醉後叙旧赠东川陈书记 · 薛逢","name":"北亭醉後叙旧赠东川陈书记","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"二十年前事尽空，半随波浪半随风。\n谋身喜断韩鸡尾，辱命羞携楚鹊笼。\n符竹谬分锦水外，妻孥犹隔散关东。\n临岐莫怪朱弦绝，曾是君家入爨桐。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"薛逢","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_30244.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30244","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}